sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API as API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    User->>Web: email, password, optional keep me signed in
    Web->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>DB: find user, compare password hash
    API->>DB: create session row, limit 5 active sessions
    API->>DB: resolve organizations and locations
    API-->>Web: access token, session cookie, selection flags
    alt one organization with one location
        Web->>Web: store active organization and location
    else several organizations or locations
        Web->>User: show the location selector
        User->>Web: choose organization and location
        Web->>API: POST /auth/select-location
        API->>DB: validate access, save last accessed
        API-->>Web: active organization id, active location id
    end
    Web->>API: GET /me/access with tenant headers
    API-->>Web: permissions, features, home page
    Web->>User: open the home page
    Note over Web,API: Later 401 answer triggers POST /auth/refresh using the cookie
